        "kcal": 1400,
        "line": "🍽️ Thin day. Your bowl stays half-full — the other half goes to Stan, who's been quiet about being hungry."
      },
      {
        "day": 44,
        "vid": "meera_reddy",
        "kcal": 1390,
        "line": "🍽️ You push half your bowl across the fire to Meera — 'eat. You need it more than I do.' Meera doesn't argue. The bowl comes back scraped clean."
      },
      {
        "day": 47,
        "vid": "gen_0yax8nh",
        "kcal": 1200,
        "line": "🍽️ You wave off the second scoop and nod toward Vicente. 'Vicente eats first tonight.' Nobody at the fire disagrees."
      },
      {
        "day": 55,
        "vid": "visjoin_45",
        "kcal": 1344,
        "line": "🍽️ The bins are thin, and Molly looks it. You set your second half in front of Molly. 'Eat,' you say. Molly eats like someone making up for days."
      }
    ]
